      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好厉害！她获得压倒性的胜利！？\n不过第二名选手也直到最后都紧咬不放……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2fc52ac2305cad77b7d81dfe9066645e2adc1555d1bb4924c7b150704d97415",
